{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54897","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵行次，鹰鹗面（京本作「鹞向」）前飞。\n所向进兵应（京本作「须」）大胜，必能捉彼将兵（辛本、川本作「师」、京本作「帅」）归，天意助神威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}